desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "csharp"
	title: "检测 C# Cookie HttpOnly 关闭"
	title_zh: "检测 C# Cookie HttpOnly 关闭"
	type: vuln
	level: medium
	rule_id: "source-csharp-cookie-httponly-false"
	risk: "cookie-security"
	cwe: "CWE-1004"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
`new HttpCookie(...)` 之后把 `HttpOnly` 设为 `false`，或 `web.config` 的 `httpCookies httpOnlyCookies="false"`，会话 Cookie 可被页面脚本读取。存在 XSS 时，攻击者的脚本可直接取走会话标识，Cookie 窃取不再需要网络中间人。

### 风险类型
cookie-security

### 影响
XSS 危害被放大：脚本可读取会话 Cookie 并发起带外外传，实现会话劫持。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，定位源码中的危险调用或配置。命中只说明出现了对应写法，需要人工确认该 Cookie 是否承载会话。注释、字符串和文档中的相同文本也会命中。
匹配 `HttpOnly = false`、`httpOnlyCookies="false"` 两种写法。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
- 会话与认证类 Cookie 保持 `HttpOnly = true`（ASP.NET 默认开启，不要显式关闭）。
- `web.config` 设置 `httpCookies httpOnlyCookies="true"`。
- 只有前端脚本必须读取的偏好类 Cookie 才可关闭 HttpOnly。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.cs": <<<POS
using System.Web;

public class CookieDemo {
    public HttpCookie Bad() {
        var c = new HttpCookie("sid");
        c.HttpOnly = false;
        return c;
    }
}

POS
	"safefile://ok.cs": <<<NEG
using System.Web;

public class CookieDemo {
    public HttpCookie Ok() {
        var c = new HttpCookie("sid");
        c.HttpOnly = true;
        return c;
    }
}

NEG
)
${*.cs}.pattern_regex(/HttpOnly\s*=\s*false/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "medium",
	title: "检测 C# Cookie HttpOnly 关闭",
	title_zh: "检测 C# Cookie HttpOnly 关闭",
	message: "检测 C# Cookie HttpOnly 关闭",
	risk: "cookie-security",
}
